  "hints": [
    {
      "tr": "Birinci adım: `moves = hanoi(n - 1, source, spare, target)` (hedef ve yedeğin yeri değişti).",
      "en": "The first step: `moves = hanoi(n - 1, source, spare, target)` (target and spare have swapped places)."
    },
    {
      "tr": "Sonra `moves.append((source, target))` ve `moves += hanoi(n - 1, spare, target, source)`; sonunda `return moves`.",
      "en": "Then `moves.append((source, target))` and `moves += hanoi(n - 1, spare, target, source)`; finally `return moves`."
    },
    {
      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı:\n\n```python\ndef hanoi(n, source, target, spare):\n    if n == 0:\n        return []\n    moves = hanoi(n - 1, source, spare, target)\n    moves.append((source, target))\n    moves += hanoi(n - 1, spare, target, source)\n    return moves\n\n\nfor move in hanoi(3, \"A\", \"C\", \"B\"):\n    print(move[0], \"->\", move[1])\nprint(len(hanoi(10, \"A\", \"C\", \"B\")))\n```",
      "en": "The full solution:\n\n```python\ndef hanoi(n, source, target, spare):\n    if n == 0:\n        return []\n    moves = hanoi(n - 1, source, spare, target)\n    moves.append((source, target))\n    moves += hanoi(n - 1, spare, target, source)\n    return moves\n\n\nfor move in hanoi(3, \"A\", \"C\", \"B\"):\n    print(move[0], \"->\", move[1])\nprint(len(hanoi(10, \"A\", \"C\", \"B\")))\n```"
    }
  ],
